    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d918">

                <pb facs="0743" n="667" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg667"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/7597</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Simpich to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nogales, Arizona</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-04-15T17:00:00-07:23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 15, 1916, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Telegraphic reports to Calles say family of John Lehr captured in November by
                    Yaquis has been rescued by General Martinez and will be returned first
                    opportunity to Lehr at Saqui Grande. District continues quiet. Agents report
                    Cananea and Ensanada orderly.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Simpich</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
